      "rationale": "The span directly supplies the condition and proposed next operation."
    }
  },
  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C019.signal_basis",
    "value": "Group and complement tests yield no failure-reproducing reduction under fixed test conditions. Finer removals are then tested, using the same repetition rule and retaining unresolved outcomes as unresolved.",
    "scope": "The selected case's reduction search, subject to the stated safety, feasibility and day-9 stopping limits.",
